tion-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-160789" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a8cacf0e1948298e0eb7454030623b73f5e4f7dded78ab2c4610490107f291e5"} {"question" "q-160789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-160789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "s\\in (-1,0)"] ["math" "s\\in (-1,1)"] ["math" "s\\in (-1,\\infty )"] ["math" "s\\in (-\\infty ,1)"] ["math" "s\\in (0,1)"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-160789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "s\\in (-1,1)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(2t)\\,i+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j+({t}^{3}+1)\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne .\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the 1st component $\\operatorname{cot}⁡(2t)$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ except for the values of $t$ for which\n\n$$\n2t=\\pi n\\,⟹\\,t=\\frac{\\pi n}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The domain of the 2nd component $\\operatorname{cos}⁡t$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 3rd component ${t}^{3}+1$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi n}{2},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a8cacf0e1948298e0eb7454030623b73f5e4f7dded78ab2c4610490107f291e5"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162646" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\pi n"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi n}{2}"] ["math" "\\f