on" "q-162650" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the 1st component $1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(3t)$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ except for the values of $t$ for which\n\n$$\n3t=\\pi n\\,⟹\\,t=\\frac{\\pi n}{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The domain of the 2nd component $3t$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 3rd component $2-{t}^{2}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi n}{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162650" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a8cacf0e1948298e0eb7454030623b73f5e4f7dded78ab2c4610490107f291e5"} {"question" "q-162650" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033854/state.json" "file_sha256" "e1cf79d49ee48a8e9956d7e3acdd65b1977b8641061a1ba3af88e1b6ce3d497d"} {"question" "q-162650" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3\\pi n"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi n}{3}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi n}{6}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\pi n"] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi n}{3}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/mult